.TH QUIPU-PROPOSE-PLAN 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-propose\-plan \- Report a pending proposal\*(Aqs blast radius and 0\-100 risk score without writing; exit 0 pass, 1 over threshold, 2 not determined
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu propose plan\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-risk\-threshold\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIid\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report a pending proposal\*(Aqs blast radius and 0\-100 risk score without writing; exit 0 pass, 1 over threshold, 2 not determined
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-risk\-threshold\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIid\fR>

